    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Psychological Horror Based on a True Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trust Me</i> puts you in the shoes of someone living through a terrifying night. After visiting his mother\u2019s house, the protagonist sets off on a journey home \u2014 only to encounter chilling and inexplicable events. This story is inspired by real-life experiences, adding a disturbing sense of realism to every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/84d0ba72f0c82ec1461e6d4f58fea851.poster.avif?t=1755666175\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/84d0ba72f0c82ec1461e6d4f58fea851.webm?t=1755666175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/84d0ba72f0c82ec1461e6d4f58fea851.mp4?t=1755666175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive First-Person Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a slow-paced, tension-driven design, <i>Trust Me</i> focuses on atmospheric storytelling and realistic interactions. Players explore their surroundings, make environmental observations, and witness the unsettling unraveling of the protagonist\u2019s reality \u2014 all from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2000s Retro Horror Feel:</strong> VHS-style visuals, analog interference, and period-accurate scenery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creeping Audio Design:</strong> Echoes, silence, ambient noise \u2014 every sound builds tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Depth:</strong> A surreal journey into fear, memory, and mental distortion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Through Isolation:</strong> From driving scenes to eerie, empty spaces \u2014 expect dread at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by True Events:</strong> The story draws directly from real-world incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/1a92c9f6f63afd893770343fda0b4ec2.poster.avif?t=1755666175\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/1a92c9f6f63afd893770343fda0b4ec2.webm?t=1755666175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/1a92c9f6f63afd893770343fda0b4ec2.mp4?t=1755666175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who Is This Game For?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players who love psychological horror, eerie environments, and slow-burning tension. Streamers and content creators will find plenty of material for reaction-filled moments, while horror fans will appreciate the unsettling authenticity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visual Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a distinct blend of 3D environments with a retro aesthetic. VHS glitch effects, low lighting, and nostalgic visuals combine with subtle realism to create a unique atmosphere reminiscent of found-footage horror from the late 20th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/af0624db0e199eafe1b2c6a08b196c5a.poster.avif?t=1755666175\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/af0624db0e199eafe1b2c6a08b196c5a.webm?t=1755666175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/af0624db0e199eafe1b2c6a08b196c5a.mp4?t=1755666175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
