kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/af0624db0e199eafe1b2c6a08b196c5a.webm?t=1755666175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836380/extras/af0624db0e199eafe1b2c6a08b196c5a.mp4?t=1755666175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
